{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpgCThFtrYBpZS3xSC9c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision: DR-9102\n\nI'll work through the discount approval procedure systematically.\n\n## 1. The Request\n\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Request ID | DR-9102 |\n| Customer (CRM) | CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing) |\n| Customer (ERP) | C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings) |\n| Product SKU | NS-EDGE |\n| Requested discount | 25% of list price ($85,000) |\n| Request date | 2026-09-23 |\n| Requestor | Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example) |\n| Basis | Competitive pricing (not a contract term) |\n\n## 2. The Customer\n\n**CRM-2048** is Acme Manufacturing, a **Strategic** account tier. The ERP bill-to is **C-1001** (Acme Mfg. Holdings). These are the same legal entity at different addresses in the system. The account owner is Sarah Chen.\n\n## 3. The Product\n\n**NS-EDGE** (NS-Edge Monitoring Package), SKU: NS-EDGE, list price: **$85,000**\n\n## 4. Active Contract\n\nThe **Master Supply Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025)** is active on 2026-09-23:\n- Effective: 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\n- Covers: NS-500, NS-Cloud, and **NS-EDGE** ✓\n\n## 5. Pricing Exception\n\n**Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15** exists:\n- Scope: **NS-500 only** (not NS-EDGE)\n- Maximum discount: 15%\n- Effective: 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\n\n**No pricing exception covers NS-EDGE on 2026-09-23.** The exception is scoped to NS-500 only.\n\n## 6. Policy in Effect\n\n**Northstar Pricing Policy 2026** (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31):\n\n| Discount range | Required approval |\n|---|---|\n| ≤10% | Enterprise Account Executive |\n| >10% and ≤20% | VP Sales |\n| >20% | Chief Revenue Officer |\n\n## 7. Requestor's Approval Authority\n\n**Sarah Chen** holds the title **Enterprise Account Executive**.\n\nUnder the 2026 policy, an Enterprise Account Executive may approve discounts up to and including **10%**.\n\nThe requested discount is **25%**, which exceeds her authority.\n\n## 8. Required Approver\n\nFor a discount of 25% (exceeds 20%), the required role is **Chief Revenue Officer**.\n\n**David Morgan** holds this role (david.morgan@northstar.example).\n\n## 9. Commercial Eligibility\n\n- **Status:** Eligible\n- **Basis:** Active contract ACME-MFG-2025 covers NS-EDGE; standard competitive pricing basis; no pricing exception limits this product or discount\n- **Maximum discount under policy:** Not capped (CRO has authority for >20%)\n\n## 10. Decision\n\nThe request:\n- Relies on **standard competitive pricing**, not special contract terms\n- Is for a product covered by an active customer contract\n- **Exceeds the requestor's authority** (25% > 10%)\n- Can be approved by the CRO under the approval authority matrix\n\n**Eligibility is established, but the discount exceeds the requestor's authority.**\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9102\",\n    \"customer\": \"CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-EDGE\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"25%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"standard\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": null,\n    \"basis\": \"Active Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025 (2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31) covers NS-EDGE; standard competitive pricing; no pricing exception restricts this product\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"≤10%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Chief Revenue Officer\",\n    \"approver\": \"David Morgan\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025 (active, covers NS-EDGE)\",\n    \"Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (scope: NS-500 only, does not apply)\",\n    \"Pricing Policy 2026 (CRO authority for discounts >20%)\",\n    \"Organization Chart: David Morgan is Chief Revenue Officer\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```\n\n**Next step:** Submit to David Morgan, Chief Revenue Officer, for approval."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25255,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25255},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54c637b3-45cd-4340-b254-64024e5f142d","uuid":"d6c9652f-060d-490e-a023-f00ad5e83d0f","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:18:23.365Z","request_id":"req_011CfpgCTPQJhZVxN7kTsRRh"}
